  "method": "read-only whole-source review; clean_text being unused was spot-checked",
  "findings": [
    "clean_text and combine_title_body are never called; no translation or language detection exists although a text_translated column is used",
    "Reddit listings are fetched as public JSON through a third-party scraping proxy without OAuth or backoff; nothing connects the scraper to the database",
    "Clustering comparisons use silhouette with noise excluded and ARI against subreddits; no DBCV; the grid search picks a min-max composite without a noise penalty across different UMAP spaces",
    "The LLM trend summary is unvalidated, its references are not checked against the inputs, and it is shown as fact; the API delays responses to simulate processing"
  ],
